{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103329","id":2360377387,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6MsIAr","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103329","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103329.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103329.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103329","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103329/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103329/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103329/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b7a0c00fdc4297a216717ba1efbf4121cf60d803","number":103329,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add error handling for array get method","user":{"login":"arthurlw","id":126365160,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4gt6A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126365160?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arthurlw","html_url":"https://github.com/arthurlw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arthurlw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arthurlw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arthurlw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arthurlw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arthurlw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arthurlw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arthurlw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arthurlw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arthurlw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Issue: The `Array::get(int p_idx)` function in Godot calls `operator[](p_idx)`, which does not perform bounds checking, leading to a crash when accessing an out-of-bounds index.\r\n\r\nSolution: Add `ERR_FAIL_INDEX_MSG(p_idx, size(), Variant());` in `get()` and `operator[]` to prevent invalid memory access and ensure safe error handling.\r\n\r\nFixes #103328\r\n\r\n\r\nPR adds bounds checking to both `Array::get(int p_idx)` and `Array::operator[](int p_idx)` so that invalid accesses are caught and handled with a proper error message. `operator[]` could probably be reverted to its previous state for performance reasons if necessary.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-02-26T18:19:54Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T17:13:37Z","closed_at":"2025-02-27T17:13:27Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7170f103ce5ad58bfaf375c8c18ca1a6e4abc3c5","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"arthurlw:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":939553483,"node_id":"R_kgDOOAByyw","name":"godot","full_name":"arthurlw/godot","owner":{"login":"arthurlw","id":126365160,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4gt6A","avatar_url":"h